    text: 'Incident command: multiple casualties reported on Moor Road. You are first on scene. Safety, then report.'
  - minute: 12
    text: 'Incident command: more units are coming but the road is flooding. Use the green zone for anyone who can walk.'
  - minute: 26
    text: 'Fire service: we''re on scene at the bus fire. Keep casualties clear of the rear.'
  bystanders: 2
